\newlabel{fig:pareto}{{1a}{6}{Accuracy-latency trade-off. Dual-mode Qwen3.5-0.8B ($\approx $3~s, 89\%) sits on the efficient frontier, offering the best accuracy per unit latency. Single-mode Qwen3.5-2B reaches the highest Task Accuracy (92\%) but at 4$\times $ the latency (12~s)}{figure.caption.11}{}}
\newlabel{sub@fig:pareto}{{a}{6}{Accuracy-latency trade-off. Dual-mode Qwen3.5-0.8B ($\approx $3~s, 89\%) sits on the efficient frontier, offering the best accuracy per unit latency. Single-mode Qwen3.5-2B reaches the highest Task Accuracy (92\%) but at 4$\times $ the latency (12~s)}{figure.caption.11}{}}
