\newlabel{fig:case_study}{{3}{8}{Real-world deployment: private on-device analytics driving behaviour change. Dual-agent Qwen3.5-0.8B (3.3~s) and Qwen3.5-2B (8.7~s) correctly route queries locally. The participant reduced snack spending by 84.7\%. Intermediate views in Figures~\ref {fig:case_mid}--\ref {fig:case_year} (Appendix)}{figure.caption.16}{}}
