\@writefile{lot}{\contentsline {table}{\numberline {9}{\ignorespaces Representative failure cases for Qwen3.5-2B (dual mode). \texttt  {PARAM\_EXTRA} is the most dangerous failure mode in financial contexts: the spurious \texttt  {months=1} filter silently restricts ``total food spending'' to ``last month's food spending'', returning a plausible but incorrect figure that a user may act on without realising the scope was changed.}}{12}{table.caption.29}\protected@file@percent }
\newlabel{tab:error_examples}{{9}{12}{Representative failure cases for Qwen3.5-2B (dual mode). \texttt {PARAM\_EXTRA} is the most dangerous failure mode in financial contexts: the spurious \texttt {months=1} filter silently restricts ``total food spending'' to ``last month's food spending'', returning a plausible but incorrect figure that a user may act on without realising the scope was changed}{table.caption.29}{}}
