\newlabel{fig:error_plot}{{4}{13}{Error taxonomy breakdown (\% of test cases) per model and architecture. Single-agent Qwen3.5-2B produces 22.6\% \texttt {PARAM\_EXTRA} errors (spurious parameters that could lead to silently incorrect financial outputs). Dual-agent eliminates most of these, consolidating residual errors into the more predictable \texttt {PARAM\_MISSING} category}{figure.caption.30}{}}
